1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:07,338
In part five, you build a complete IDM for defect management, step by step, starting from a blank project.

2
00:00:07,338 --> 00:00:12,019
After each step, a catch-up file lets you continue from the same point.

3
00:00:12,919 --> 00:00:14,331
Click Blank Project.

4
00:00:14,331 --> 00:00:16,802
The IDM header is open on the left.

5
00:00:17,702 --> 00:00:23,846
Enter the full title, Defect Management Using BCF, and the short title, DMBCF.

6
00:00:24,746 --> 00:00:28,650
Keep version one point zero, and set the status to working draft.

7
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:34,627
Add an author: click Person, open the new entry, and enter the given and family name.

8
00:00:39,650 --> 00:00:46,588
The creation date is filled in automatically, and the revision history records later changes.

9
00:00:46,588 --> 00:00:48,006
The header is done.

10
00:00:48,006 --> 00:00:52,109
The catch-up file for this step is DMBCF_5a_header.idm.

